sequenceDiagram
    participant JS as Main JS DOM
    participant W as Rust/WASM worker
    participant H as Native web host
    participant R as Agent Runner
    participant P as PostgreSQL
    Note over JS,W: Default: keep through 30 days later
    JS->>W: Date / keep long term
    W->>H: Typed retention effect
    Note over H: Session + origin + CSRF
    H->>R: Private retention DTO
    Note over R: Resolve date or no expiry
    R->>P: Lock chat; check revision
    Note over R,P: Missing / stale stops update
    R->>P: Set policy + new revision
    P-->>R: Commit saved policy
    R-->>H: Correlated result
    H-->>W: Checked response
    W-->>JS: Render saved policy
    Note over JS,W: Errors preserve draft
    Note over R,P: Current UI sends UTC
